        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n*** STUNNING 4 BEDROOM / 3 BATHROOM HOUSE *** IMMACULATE CONDITION *** AVAILABLE NOW ***\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS proudly present this exceptional four-bedroom, three-bathroom house to the rental market, ideally located on the ever-popular Cuil Duin Walk, Citywest, Dublin 24.\nThis superb home is presented in immaculate condition throughout and offers bright, spacious, and well-proportioned living accommodation finished to a high standard. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a generous living room, a modern fully fitted kitchen with dining area, four spacious bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, a stylish main bathroom, and a convenient guest WC. Externally, the property benefits from a private rear garden, perfect for relaxing or entertaining. The property is ideally positioned within this highly sought-after development and offers ample parking nearby.\nCuil Duin Walk is a modern and highly desirable residential development in the heart of Citywest, ideally located close to an excellent range of local amenities including Citywest Shopping Centre, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, parks, and leisure facilities. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with the Red Line LUAS just a short distance away, numerous Dublin Bus routes nearby, and excellent access to the N7, M50, and all major road networks, making commuting across Dublin and beyond simple and convenient.\nViewing is highly recommended.\nAdditional Features:\nStunning 4 Bed / 3 Bath house\nBright and spacious living accommodation\nModern fully fitted kitchen with dining area\nFour generous bedrooms\nMaster bedroom with en-suite\nStylish main bathroom\nGuest WC\nPrivate rear garden\nHighly sought-after residential development\nExcellent public transport links\nEasy access to the M50, N7 and LUAS\nAvailable immediately\n \nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE."
